{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）早上6時40分，警方接報指，秀茂坪邨秀緻樓地下一辦事處被人淋紅油。現場為立法會議員鄧家彪和陳沛良的聯合地區辦事處，鐵閘和告示版均被淋紅油。警方將案件列作「刑事毀壞」調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場為立法會議員鄧家彪和陳沛良的聯合地區辦事處，鐵閘和告示版均被淋紅油。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184771816216858624590124.jpeg/Ji_al206zBdZMm9svf-aht8AEpqi9cNxWYKoolmCqKI\"/><figcaption>現場為立法會議員鄧家彪和陳沛良的聯合地區辦事處，鐵閘和告示版均被淋紅油。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵閘和告示版均被淋潑紅油。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184771823641038848679184.jpeg/yviDoJ1r5G5xS_CRY1jjp9C8xmma7wqo1In2P9SJ9j8\"/><figcaption>鐵閘和告示版均被淋潑紅油。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵閘和告示版均被淋潑紅油。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184771819807313920610923.jpeg/ilcAwlijiAnal2fXzmD4Fb4JbLfnAEQ6bT6VxW0-lcU\"/><figcaption>鐵閘和告示版均被淋潑紅油。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方將案件列作「刑事毀壞」調查。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184771827025973248460795.jpeg/UbL5jZRhbVNFQErXnyPUlScFfYWYywnOqrNVOqqzVTo\"/><figcaption>警方將案件列作「刑事毀壞」調查。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T23:59:36.597448+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}